Scene: AnimalShortCoat.olo
# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# SHORT-COATED ANIMAL fixture (issue #1239).
#
# Khronos Fox (glTF-Sample-Assets): skinned, three clips, coat painted
# into a single 1K albedo texture — which is exactly how a shipping
# short-coated character is authored, so this fixture is a REAL
# measurement rather than a stand-in.
#
# The Walk clip plays, driven by the capture manifest's fixed dt, so a
# moving-sequence camera sees genuine skinned deformation in the
# velocity buffer and not just camera parallax.
#
# Fox.gltf is authored in CENTIMETRES (bbox ~79 units tall), hence the
# 0.01 scale — the units field in the manifest provenance block records
# this, because a silently mis-scaled subject invalidates every
# screen-coverage number taken from the capture.
#
# Ground, sky and light rig are IDENTICAL to the other animal fixture, so
# the short- and long-coated captures differ only in the subject.
#
# GENERATED by OloEngine/tests/scripts/generate_reference_fixture_scenes.py
# (issue #1239) — edit the generator and regenerate rather than hand-editing.
# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
